From b22d9bfab76744fb6ed184ce51546dbd8194a392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Naqib Muhammad Faiyaz <naqib3110@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:40:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Integrate LibreChat management with Hermes profiles and
 execution

Add the authenticated Hermes workspace, private runtime adapter, managed execution policy, profile/model catalog and publishing, lossless management proxy, and deployment configuration. Include 17 contract tests, 7 workspace UI tests, telemetry privacy coverage, capability inventory and operations documentation. Preserve the shared-workspace identity boundary explicitly.
